# ASUS ExpertBook Ultra (B9406CAA) PixArt I2C-HID haptic touchpad (093A:4F05)
# The pad's HID report descriptor gives Tip Pressure no Logical Maximum of its
# own, so it inherits the Y field's 2601, far above anything a real press
# reports. libinput's pressure-based touch detection then drops every motion
# as a "Touch jump". Ignore the pressure axes; the pad reports BTN_TOUCH
# reliably. Same shape as the Asus UX302LA entry in
# /usr/share/libinput/50-system-asus.quirks. The sister pad 093A:4811 was
# fixed upstream with AttrInputProp=+INPUT_PROP_PRESSUREPAD (libinput 1.32).
[ASUS ExpertBook Ultra B9406 Touchpad]
MatchUdevType=touchpad
MatchBus=i2c
MatchVendor=0x093A
MatchProduct=0x4F05
MatchDMIModalias=dmi:*svnASUS*:pn*B9406*
AttrEventCode=-ABS_MT_PRESSURE;-ABS_PRESSURE;
